    "title": "Pi Day Deals Offer Discounted Pies and Pizzas on March 14 - Laredo Today",
    "text": "Mar. 14, 2026 at 12:16am Got story updates? Submit your updates here. ›Restaurants and pizza chains across the country are offering special deals and discounts for Pi Day on March 14, 2026. Deals include $3.14 pizzas, free pies with purchase, and up to 31.4% off select pies shipped nationwide. Participating brands include 7-Eleven, Burger King, Blaze Pizza, Crumbl, Pizza Hut, Goldbelly, Grimaldi's Pizzeria, Anthony's Coal Fired Pizza & Wings, BJ's Restaurants & Brewhouse, and more. Why it matters Pi Day, celebrated on March 14 each year, is a popular food holiday that allows restaurants and food chains to offer creative deals and discounts to attract customers. These special offers make it easy for people to enjoy their favorite pies, pizzas, and other treats at a discounted price, providing an opportunity for both businesses and consumers to celebrate the day. The details Restaurants and chains are offering a variety of Pi Day deals, including $3.14 pizzas at 7-Eleven, free Hershey's Sundae Pie or Cinnamon Apple Pie with a $3.14 purchase at Burger King, buy-one-get-one-free 11-inch pizzas at Blaze Pizza, and up to 31.4% off select \"regional PIE-cons\" shipped nationwide through Goldbelly. Other deals include $3.14 pizza slices at Grimaldi's Pizzeria, $3.14 10-inch coal-fired cheese pizzas at Anthony's Coal Fired Pizza & Wings, and buy-one-get-one-free Pizookies at BJ's Restaurants & Brewhouse. March 14, 2026 is Pi Day, the day these special offers will be available. The players 7-ElevenA convenience store chain offering $3.14 pizzas, quesadillas, and snack pies on March 13 and 14.Burger KingA fast-food restaurant chain offering a free Hershey's Sundae Pie or Cinnamon Apple Pie with a $3.14 purchase on March 14 for Royal Perks members.Blaze PizzaA fast-casual pizza chain offering a buy-one-get-one-free 11-inch pizza deal on March 14.GoldbellyAn online marketplace offering up to 31.4% off select \"regional PIE-cons\" or famous pies shipped nationwide.Grimaldi's PizzeriaA pizza restaurant chain selling pizza slices for $3.14 on Pi Day. Got photos? Submit your photos here. › What they’re saying “Pi Day is the perfect excuse to eat more pie than usual.”— Kelly O'Sullivan, Senior Editor The takeaway These Pi Day deals offer a fun and affordable way for people to celebrate the day by indulging in their favorite pies, pizzas, and other sweet treats. The wide range of participating restaurants and chains ensures there are options for everyone to enjoy the discounts and specials.",
